Good afternoon,

Stonehaven Builders is acting as construction manager on this project and is issuing this solicitation on the Owner's behalf. Submit bids to Stonehaven; the contract will be held directly with the Owner.

The Owner is Harborlight Logistics Trust.

The project is the Harborlight Distribution Centre Mechanical Package.

The facility is in Broomfield, CO.

This package covers HVAC, sheet metal, and fire protection. The fire protection scope is included in the base bid and is not an alternate.

The Owner's budget is $1,540,000.

Bids are due November 2, 2026 at 2:00 PM MT.

Site walk: October 15, 2026 at 8:00 AM.

Bonding: bid bond 5% of the total bid; performance bond and payment bond each 100% of the contract price. Commercial general liability $2,000,000 per occurrence and $4,000,000 aggregate.

Construction runs April 12, 2027 to September 17, 2027.

Perpetua Vandermolen-Ashby, Stonehaven Builders
